            "synthesis_para" : "A series of CuxCey-pre (x=0, 1, 2, 3, 4, y=0, 1, 2, 3, 4) catalysts with different molar ratios were prepared using the co-precipitation method. Certain amounts of Cu(NO3)2⋅6H2O and Ce(NO3)3⋅6H2O with designated Cu/Ce molar ratios were dissolved in 20 mL of deionized water. Next, NaOH aqueous solution (1 mol/L) was added and stirred vigorously at room temperature (RT) for 2 h. Then, the precipitant powder was collected and washed four times with deionized water. Later, the collected solid was dried at 110 °C for 12 h and calcined in air at 500 °C (10 °C /min) for 5 h to obtain the CuxCey-pre catalyst.",
